{"id":"429087","name":"现腌萝卜","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/429087/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"6茶匙(30ml)"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"1茶匙(5ml)"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"2茶匙"},{"name":"糖","amount":"1.5茶匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1.5茶匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜削皮，切薄片。","img":"images/429087/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放盐腌10-15分钟，去水份和辣味。","img":"images/429087/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"萝卜放水洗去盐份。","img":"images/429087/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"沥干水份。","img":"images/429087/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"生抽，老抽，白胡椒粉和糖拌匀。没老抽可以不放，用生抽代替，主要是上色用。","img":"images/429087/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把萝卜放在大碗里，淋上酱汁。","img":"images/429087/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌30分钟即可。中途翻拌几次。放冰箱口感更佳。","img":"images/429087/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"非常爽口开胃。","img":"images/429087/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}